abstract: >-
  ECONOVA-S™ Research Co-Scientist is an evidence-grounded, governed multi-agent scientific-discovery platform for accounting, auditing, finance, economics, sustainability, data economy, and business research. It integrates hypothesis generation and critique, ERA-style empirical conversion, AlphaEvolve-inspired model and specification search, AlphaFold-inspired latent-structure reasoning, computational discovery, AI-to-AI adversarial review, falsification, replication, Chain-of-Evidence, DAG governance, Evidence Passports, and an explicit Human Gate before scientific claims.
